{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Stick Tongue","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/stick-tongue.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/stick-tongue.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Stick Tongue","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":57,"temp":0,"max":57,"details":""},"ac":{"value":22,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":30}],"details":""},"adjustment":null},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":5},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>To the unsuspecting goblin, a stick tongue is the enormous tongue that snapped out of a tree's foliage, wrapped itself around their armpits, and snatched them up forever. In reality, they are large mantids with numerous joints that allow them to navigate tree foliage nimbly and a toad-like tongue that lets them reach their prey below. A stick tongue's limbs are often thicker than the branches, and they are covered in small, often scaly growths that resemble the leaves of their favorite trees.</p>\n<p>Their natural camouflage varies between regions. They may have a sappy, rotting bark appearance in haunted forests full of dead or undead trees or have lush green, feathery growths to sway alongside a willow tree or even large, bushy leaves in tropical environments.</p>\n<h2>Don't Lick That</h2>\n<p>Travelers in regions where stick tongues live try various tricks to protect themselves. The most common involve wearing tearaway clothing or coating their armor in slick oil, but other strategies aim to make themselves less appetizing targets. Some carry pouches of ground chili peppers, thinking the spiciness might stun the tongue. Other folk tales say that the smell of peppermint sickens the creatures, preventing them from swallowing. Which strategies work best is unknown and may vary depending on the unique tastes of each stick tongue.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 18/45/80 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, slashing), armor (medium), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Stealth, Survival)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> acid, bane, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (positive), strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Erica Abenti","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":-4},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":-4}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":11,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"},{"type":"scent","acuity":"imprecise","range":30}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":11,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":15,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":9,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":14},"athletics":{"base":12,"special":[{"label":"to Grapple with tongue","base":16,"predicate":["action:grapple:tongue"]}]},"stealth":{"base":14},"survival":{"base":10}},"traits":{"value":["animal"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/stick-tongue.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Low-Light Vision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.LowLightVision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"low-light-vision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102604562,"modifiedTime":1689102604562,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.fFu2sZz4KB01fVRc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"aWeNTRfnIOMq3e8P"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Scent (Imprecise) 30 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Scent]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"scent","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102609117,"modifiedTime":1689102618952,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.rqfnQ5VHT5hxm25r","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"6mXIMKwxlJeSjfCK"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Clever Positioning","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A stick tongue leverages foliage to shield and obscure itself. It can always @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Take Cover]{Take Cover} while in a tree and gains the benefits of Take Cover in a tree regardless of positioning or line of sight. It prefers to have greater cover as often as possible, by choosing positions that would normally grant cover without the use of this ability. If a stick tongue uses Stealth for initiative while in a tree, it uses Take Cover as part of rolling initiative.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"RsHiUILmgqYmahLE","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102713995,"modifiedTime":1689102735872,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Retract Tongue","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy targets the stick tongue's tongue with an attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The stick tongue retracts its tongue back into its mouth. It gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. Any creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Restrained]{Restrained} by the tongue is released immediately after the attack resolves.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"ac","key":"RollOption","option":"retract-tongue","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["retract-tongue"],"selector":"ac","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"nLgAQweRc9PRiCRM","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102750294,"modifiedTime":1689102810008,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Vulnerable Tongue","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When a creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Restrained]{Restrained} by a stick tongue's tongue, creatures can attack the tongue directly to harm the stick tongue. The tongue has the same AC as the stick tongue normally does, but it can't benefit from any circumstance bonuses due to cover.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"SoOKdVcvmBrj7OJe","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102816020,"modifiedTime":1689102841056,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Grab","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedGrab]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-grab","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102864793,"modifiedTime":1689102864793,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.i18TlebMzwONyPhI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"Y5laivFOWICfXmZA"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Rehome","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The stick tongue abandons its perch for a safer tree. It Strides up to three times, ending its movement next to another three, then Takes Cover in that tree.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":3},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"cGi5Gd4QGINoGygt","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689102868260,"modifiedTime":1689102942177,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Snatch","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The stick tongue is in a tree and has a creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} with its tongue</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The stick tongue attempts an Athletics check to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Grapple]{Grapple} its prey with its tongue. If it rolls a success, it gets a critical success instead, and the stick tongue then pulls the creature up to 10 feet toward it.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"H0Bzkq7R0k8iGfux","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"defa